# Outfit head (R18): a soft hood over the voxel head, open at the face, accent rim around the opening.
# Head frame: the head fills x 1..6, y 1..5, z 1..6 (pivot 3 3 1).
name outfit_hood
grid 5
size 7 6 8
slot hood SwatchMain
slot rim SwatchAccent
ellipsoid 3.2 3 4 3.8 3.1 4 hood
carve box 1 1 1 6 5 6
carve box 5 1 1 7 5 6
paint box 5 0 0 7 6 8 rim
paint box 4 0 6 7 6 8 rim
pivot 3 3 1
